{"title":"Career Roadmap · Contracts Associate","role":"Contracts Associate","summary":"A Contracts Associate in the sports industry supports the drafting, review, negotiation and management of agreements involving athletes, clubs, leagues, sponsors, broadcasters, agencies, event organizers and other sports businesses.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Sports Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Contracts Associate in the sports industry supports the drafting, review, negotiation and management of agreements involving athletes, clubs, leagues, sponsors, broadcasters, agencies, event organizers and other sports businesses."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract law"},{"text":"Sports law"},{"text":"Commercial law"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Intellectual property"},{"text":"Sponsorship"},{"text":"Athlete representation"},{"text":"Media and broadcasting"},{"text":"Sports governance"},{"text":"Compliance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical contracts may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Player/athlete agreements"},{"text":"Employment agreements"},{"text":"Sponsorship agreements"},{"text":"Endorsement agreements"},{"text":"Appearance agreements"},{"text":"Broadcasting agreements"},{"text":"Licensing agreements"},{"text":"Merchandising agreements"},{"text":"Venue agreements"},{"text":"Event-management contracts"},{"text":"Agency/representation agreements"},{"text":"Vendor agreements"},{"text":"Technology agreements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest candidate understands both the legal structure of a contract and the commercial realities of the sports industry."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB","Contract Law + Sports Law","Sports / Commercial Law Internship",